    "e48e7062-e40c-4d95-9a40-f6c25dce4cea": {
      "type": "rich-text",
      "blocks": {
        "f6030679-fc72-4564-aad4-04fa8d712171": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "The Orenda Story",
            "heading_size": "h1",
            "heading_tag": "h2"
          }
        },
        "41d2fa21-57af-4188-a331-2fc1892183d4": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>For over two decades, <strong>Orenda<\/strong> has been a trusted partner for the health-conscious, crafting natural solutions that work in harmony with your body. Our meticulously developed formulas harness the synergistic power of premium vitamins, herbs, and supplements to support, nurture, and strengthen you from within.<\/p><p>At Orenda, we believe true wellness is the presence of abundant energy, mental clarity, and a zest for life. We're more than just a supplement company... we're your partner in empowered living, providing resources and a supportive community to help you thrive at every stage.<\/p><p>Our founders' journey began with a powerful lesson in empathy and respect. Growing up, they watched their father, a talented sales representative, face disrespect and be treated as disposable. This experience ignited a passion within them to create a company that would be different... one where every individual is valued, respected, and encouraged to reach their full potential.<\/p><p>Orenda exists to lift people up. We believe that everyone has unique talents and perspectives to offer, and that by fostering a culture of collaboration and mutual support, we can create a thriving community that empowers personal and professional growth.<\/p><p><strong>Our Core Beliefs:<\/strong><\/p><ul><li><strong>We are connected by a universal force.<\/strong> This force is the source of our unique talents and abilities, and it enables us to form meaningful connections with each other and the world around us.<\/li><li><strong>We exist to lift each other up.<\/strong> By recognizing and celebrating the value in every individual, we create a positive and supportive environment where everyone can learn, grow, and thrive.<\/li><li><strong>We are stronger together.<\/strong> Our success is rooted in our interconnectedness and our willingness to work collaboratively towards a common goal.<\/li><li><strong>We embrace diversity and inclusion.<\/strong> We celebrate the rich tapestry of human experiences, welcoming people of all ethnicities, spiritual beliefs, and lifestyles.<\/li><\/ul><p>If you're seeking a company that truly values its employees, independent partners, and customers, Orenda is your ideal match. We are dedicated to creating a positive, supportive environment where everyone can flourish.<\/p><p>Discover the transformative potential of Orenda's natural solutions and unlock the secret to ageless vitality. Your journey to optimal wellness starts here<\/p>",
            "text_size": "typeset2",
            "secondary_color": false
          }
        }
      },
